msgid "![../\\_images/cf27e1ef03e51b2360c90165a4efeaa793da36083bb674774ca06c8181ef63dd.png](/docs/images/addons/samplomatic/cf27e1ef03e51b2360c90165a4efeaa793da36083bb674774ca06c8181ef63dd.avif)\n"
